nce between Blueiot and Valkor?\\\"}],null]}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"mt-3 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Blueiot/LocalSense can provide the RTLS infrastructure layer: tags, anchors, positioning, area data, alarms, attendance primitives, and device-health signals. Valkor turns those signals into school workflows, privacy controls, audit logs, command views, and pilot proof.\\\"}],null]}]\\n\"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"15:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"article\\\",\\\"Does Valkor replace emergency procedures?\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"rounded-[1.5rem] border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 p-5\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"flex items-start justify-between gap-4\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"h3\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-lg font-semibold text-slate-950\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Does Valkor replace emergency procedures?\\\"}],null]}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"mt-3 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"No. Valkor does not replace school staff, radios, alarms, law enforcement, fire department guidance, emergency plans, or human judgment.\\\"}],null]}]\\n\"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"16:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"section\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"rounded-[2rem] bg-slate-950 p-6 text-white shadow-2xl shadow-slate-300/60 sm:p-8\\\",\\\"children\\\":[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"grid gap-6 lg:grid-cols-[1fr_auto] lg:items-center\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",null,{\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"h2\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-3xl font-semibold tracking-[-0.03em]\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Request a limited pilot review.\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"mt-3 max-w-3xl text-sm leading-6 text-slate-300\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Pilot reviews cover operational pain points, privacy and governance boundaries, infrastructure readiness, pilot scope, reliability